# Craft lab agent policy

- Close the write loop before PR: `cmake . && make` then `./test_runner` (once harness exists). Never open a red PR.
- Honour the path allowlist in the task prompt. Stop if you need files outside the allowlist.
- No drive-by rewrites; no intentional gameplay changes unless asked.
- Docs-only tasks must not edit `src/**`.
- PR body: Goal, Allowlist, Proof (commands + pass/fail), Tests, Manual playtest, Inner-loop red→green notes.
- Follow `docs/GAME_MAP.md` and `docs/ADR-001-*.md`; do not invent architecture.
- Fork only — not upstream fogleman/Craft.
